<title>SPAIN: FORECAST - H.Cantabrico 96 net seen up.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - H.Cantabrico 96 net seen up.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market forecasts for 1996 results of Spanish electricity firm Hidroelectrica del Cantabrico. Simple averages of analysts forecasts.</p>
<p>In billion of pesetas.</p>
<p>				   1996	  1995	    RANGE</p>
<p>    Operating Income	109.71     113.02    119.00-101.45</p>
<p>    Net attributable	 14.64	12.94    14.90- 14.40</p>
<p>Contributors: AB Asesores, ABN-Amro, Ahorro Corporacion, Benito y Monjardin, Beta Capital, Credit Lyonnais, Ibersecurities.</p>
<p>Hidrocantabrico is expected to release its results from mid-February.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2167</p>
